16. Build order for another AI
1. Create repository skeleton and schemas first. No provider-specific business logic yet.
2. Implement PostgreSQL schema for models, versions, campaigns, tests, results, evidence, calibration and provenance.
3. Implement NATS subjects and a minimal campaign manager.
4. Integrate NeMo Evaluator and lm-evaluation-harness through adapters.
5. Implement deterministic scoring, result normalization and content-addressed artifacts.
6. Implement Model Genome calculation with uncertainty and calibration, not just percentages.
7. Add Qdrant + Tantivy + AGE knowledge pipeline.
8. Implement Brain retrieval with source ranking, temporal filters and evidence bundles.
9. Implement augmentation A/B testing: model-only versus model+brain versus tool-assisted.
10. Add multimodal adapters: Whisper/faster-whisper/WhisperX, ViSQOL/SpeechBrain, VLMEvalKit/OpenCLIP, VideoScore/GenAI-Bench.
11. Add local inference backends: llama.cpp first, then vLLM/SGLang workers.
12. Add Temporal for long campaigns and resumability.
13. Add router policy learning based on quality/cost/latency/augmentation gain.
14. Add license auditor and dependency SBOM/allowlist enforcement.
15. Load-test from 10k to 1M tests before considering larger campaigns.
16. Create a private holdout suite that is never exposed to the evaluator model and is regenerated periodically.
